{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラマ　「路地裏ホテル」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全話配信されました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご視聴頂いた方々ありがとうございました"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobW2RHs0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobx64Awi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpSGasT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛に溢れた現場で、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふとした時に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛だ !  ってなってました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぱっと思い出したお話だと、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "結婚式のシーンで塗る用のネイルが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サイリウムカラーだった事。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとは、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "合宿の時に食べたメニューと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同じご飯を用意してくださった事。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他にもたくさんあります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私達が楽しく撮影できるように"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スタッフさんが色々考えてくださいました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラマチームの皆様の事が"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だーーいすきです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobx6HLBd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/moboICDki.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優月ちゃんとたくさん台本読んだなーー"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリの休憩中、お部屋に集まって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "練習してました"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobBYGqJT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めての経験も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんだった"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob9Q56yU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobQJ47sr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全員集合のシーンも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮らせていただけて嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "クランクアップのお弁当に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大喜びの三期生でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影終了後には"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりに三期生とご飯を食べました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発信するための写真を撮ったりはしてないけど"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういうところもすきだなあって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "思いますね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その場を楽しんでる感じがすきです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またいつか三期生で何かできたら良いなあ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobfmIjS1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラマ「路地裏ホテル」に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "関わってくださった全ての皆様、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このドラマを通して"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出会えた方々、出会えた感情"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全部宝物です~"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}], "source": "official"}